OL,3,GNEWSALicensing laws, VAT and festivals-
OL,4,Ahas it been a bumper season for
OL,5,Atourism?
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's been a summer of hot weather and
OL,8,Fbig events, perfect conditions, you'd
OL,9,Fthink, for a bumper tourism season.
OL,11,FBut according to industry leaders the
OL,12,Fpicture across Northern Ireland has
OL,13,Fbeen more mixed.
OL,15,FAccording to Tourism NI "the vast
OL,16,Fmajority of tourism businesses are
OL,17,Flargely optimistic".
OL,19,FBut are they?
